# 百度地图 API Keys
# Baidu Map API Keys Configuration

# 浏览器端 API Key (Browser-side) - 用于前端地图显示和交互
# Used for: front.py web interface, map display, POI search, route visualization
BAIDU_MAP_AK=PQs7CZEekMDpIjULh5eaG9OhuhNv1vsm

# 服务端 API Key (Server-side) - 用于后端路线计算和地理编码
# Used for: server-side route calculations, geocoding, distance calculations
# Note: This key is already configured in api_test/server_api_test.py
# BAIDU_SERVER_AK=iwanSLLaXU0mNHxKG6MpczCl8bCVsvSe

# 使用说明 / Usage Instructions:
# 1. 复制此文件为 .env (不要提交到版本控制)
#    Copy this file to .env (do not commit to version control)
# 2. 浏览器端和服务端 AK 功能不同，请勿混用
#    Browser-side and server-side AKs serve different purposes, do not mix them
# 3. 运行前端: BAIDU_MAP_AK=PQs7CZEekMDpIjULh5eaG9OhuhNv1vsm python front.py
#    Run frontend: BAIDU_MAP_AK=PQs7CZEekMDpIjULh5eaG9OhuhNv1vsm python front.py
